  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EW0zNrq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"781\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Reliquified Ars Nouveau</strong> 是一个连接 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Relics</strong></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ars Nouveau</strong></a> 模组的扩展，为游戏引入了多种独特圣物。这些圣物运用了不同的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ars Nouveau</strong></a> 机制，充分释放其潜力并提升游戏体验。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8z7RJwj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必要前置模组：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RELICS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARS NOUVEAU</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9ESYAYp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"472\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-ars-nouveau/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MmvYRZJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>问：在哪里可以找到本模组的圣物？</strong><br>答：所有圣物会生成在Ars Nouveau或其扩展模组添加的任何建筑或生物群系中。</p><p><strong>问：可以在整合包中使用这个模组吗？</strong><br>答：可以，欢迎随意加入。</p><p><strong>问：能否将本模组转载到其他平台？</strong><br>答：不可以。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLgKo87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified_ars_nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bArs%2bNouveau%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们的其他模组？ - 访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>",
